  "totalBlocks": 31,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebcae96010fa9f9b",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了一个推理引擎 InferredThoughts，用于那些无法放入 VRAM + RAM 的 MoE 模型。模型的大部分保留在 SSD 上，并且专家会根据需要读取为 tokens。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80d69c3ebf8fabaa",
      "translationZh": "这最初是一个概念验证，poc 有效，我们在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 上获得了 9-10 tok/s 的解码速度（基准测试 turn 为 9.06，最佳 turn 为 10.4）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4a0855f6725e3ab",
      "translationZh": "这只是个开始。随着更好的 SSD 流式传输，我们预期 v2 将达到约 14-15 tok/s 的解码速度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191f009a8d76fde2",
      "translationZh": "仓库：InferredThoughts https://github.com/compiledthoughts/Inferred-Thoughts",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b758f471e7dd128a",
      "translationZh": "模型：Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，176.9B 参数，NVFP4 GGUF (119 GiB)：https://huggingface.co/CompiledThoughts/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-Q8_0",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7544d50fd71116a1",
      "translationZh": "机器：RTX 5060 Ti 16 GB，Ryzen 7 9700X，32 GB DDR5，Gen5 NVMe SSD 1Tb，Windows 11",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a6fe586ba42129c",
      "translationZh": "文件大小的一部分",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e8b184f87313406",
      "translationZh": "密集权重（attention, shared experts, LM head）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a5fecbff7b869ea",
      "translationZh": "RAM，每个 token 读取一行",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6780691b205f0dfd",
      "translationZh": "下一个最热门的路由专家",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dca3ba9dcc13635",
      "translationZh": "剩余的路由专家",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63cb0d308244cfbf",
      "translationZh": "SSD，每个 token 读取 16 行",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d9811df39353948",
      "translationZh": "所以 20 GiB 在内存中，99 GiB 留在 SSD 上：48.5 GiB 的路由专家，在路由器选择它们时流式传输，以及 50.7 GiB 的哈希 n-gram 表（期待 qwen4 ngram）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5cbedbc403fe506",
      "translationZh": "解码：基准轮次上为 9.06 tok/s，xhigh 努力程度下的最佳轮次为 10.4",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d90efeab87538ff1",
      "translationZh": "预填充：在 5.5k token 的提示词上为 49.2 tok/s",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f799c13bf967e4ba",
      "translationZh": "同一台机器上的 llama.cpp：平均解码 4.9 tok/s",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4a8b8deef7d4721",
      "translationZh": "显存存储密集型权重和最热门的专家（GCLOCK驱逐），固定内存是下一级（通过PCIe读取），其余的通过8个读取线程从NVMe加载。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d914d3c3b42e289",
      "translationZh": "Lookahead预取猜测下一层的专家并提前开始读取。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db57272c88808632",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4矩阵乘法在张量核心上运行FP4 x FP4，无需先解包。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d34a0be5faca17d",
      "translationZh": "每个令牌大约从SSD读取270 MiB，大约75%的专家查找命中内存。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8ff2752c0d08060",
      "translationZh": "每个令牌使用480个专家（48层中每层10个）。其中大约377个已经在显存或内存中；其余约103个从SSD读取，每个令牌约270 MiB。这个命中率使我们能够达到9tps。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71255b441f10e1a6",
      "translationZh": "它只从SSD读取且几乎没有写入，所以SSD的写入磨损应该很小。但在长时间运行中我们看到SSD达到了70C。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07bd46ca75ad3f88",
      "translationZh": "还支持：Qwen3.6-35B-A3B NVFP4。它适合放入显存+内存。你也可以通过SSD流式运行它，这是这项工作的学习曲线。在配置调优后的同一台机器上，它达到：约4k上下文下47.3 tok/s解码，591 tok/s预填充。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d56553f20c1c7ddc",
      "translationZh": "服务：一个兼容OpenAI的服务器，渲染模型的聊天模板，支持工具调用（仍有bug，用Cline测试），将推理与答案分开，并内置聊天页面。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a5977d921ec762",
      "translationZh": "v1 的限制：仅限 RTX 50 系列 / Blackwell (sm_120)，仅在 Windows 11 和 WSL2 上测试，仅限贪婪解码。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f48d4d98d5fad67a",
      "translationZh": "仓库：https://github.com/compiledthoughts/Inferred-Thoughts",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0936646a41dd9ec1",
      "translationZh": "所有模型：https://huggingface.co/CompiledThoughts",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0195903353b7c040",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提问和反馈，特别是来自任何在小型显卡上运行大型 MoE 的人。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa9344282508ad4a",
      "translationZh": "提交者：/u/TypicalPudding6190",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    }
  ],
